  "_why": "§3j.168 — the field names `scripts/extract-component-fields.py` must be asked for. The extractor selects BY FIELD NAME from argv and records nothing, so `.gamedata/component-fields.json` held whatever someone last typed. A value absent from that list is not unverifiable, only UNEXTRACTED: Helfire Tincture's burn duration sat behind exactly this and had been published as an unknown, then as 12s, when the prefab says 3. Adding two names to this list settled it.",
